In the diagram, each circle is divided into two equal areas and $O$ is the center of the largest circle. The area of the largest circle is $81\pi.$ What is the total area of the shaded regions? [asy]
size(100);
import graph;
fill(Arc((0,0),3,180,360)--cycle,mediumgray);fill(Arc((0,1.5),1.5,0,180)--cycle,mediumgray);
draw(Circle((0,0),3));
draw(Circle((0,1.5),1.5));

dot((0,0)); label("$O$",(0,0),N);
draw((-3,0)--(3,0)); draw((-1.5,1.5)--(1.5,1.5));
[/asy]

Four coplanar circles are placed as shown. What is the maximum number of points on the circles that a line passing through all four circles can touch?

