In $\Delta XYZ$, $XY = YZ$, $m\angle DZY = 50^{\circ}$, and $DZ \parallel XY$. Determine the measure of $m\angle EDZ$.

[asy] pair X,Y,Z,D,E; Y = dir(-50); X = dir(-130); D = (.5,0); E = .4 * dir(50);
draw(Z--Y--X--E,EndArrow); draw(Z--D,EndArrow);
